The protocol table's capability rules: a request with an optional array, a
union with gated variants inside an array property, and a gated variant of a
union a notification carries, each checked against the record of initialize
on what is sent and what is received
(0017-MADR-remediate-acp-v1-conformance-violations.md, G1).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {"initialize": "initialize", "new": "x/new", "prompt": "x/prompt"}, "clientMethods": {"update": "x/update"}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
